{"parentUuid":"d79adb7b-3094-4c93-8a9c-75ae5a4ecdd8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016hjqs7zfmJmLtGyAgonZ4X","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-semantic: patch\n3\tcargo/caliper-docgen: patch\n4\tnpm/caliper-docgen: patch\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t`extract` with the checker on now stops asking the checker once its heap passes a budget: 60% of the memory the process may use (the machine's, or a lower cgroup limit on Linux), at most 8 GiB. The components not yet answered keep their structural result, and one `SEMANTIC_BACKEND` warning says how many and why. A project whose own source declares a very large style system (Chakra's `packages/react/src`) grew to 42 GB before; with the budget it finishes at the budget. Which components the checker answered before the budget was reached depends on timing, so such an output can differ between runs; every corpus we measure stays at about 1 GiB, far under the budget, and its output is unchanged.\n8\t"}]},"uuid":"6aa25364-9d2a-45fe-9bc2-b12b4528b437","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:31:59.133Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/extract-heap-budget.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-semantic: patch\ncargo/caliper-docgen: patch\nnpm/caliper-docgen: patch\n---\n\n`extract` with the checker on now stops asking the checker once its heap passes a budget: 60% of the memory the process may use (the machine's, or a lower cgroup limit on Linux), at most 8 GiB. The components not yet answered keep their structural result, and one `SEMANTIC_BACKEND` warning says how many and why. A project whose own source declares a very large style system (Chakra's `packages/react/src`) grew to 42 GB before; with the budget it finishes at the budget. Which components the checker answered before the budget was reached depends on timing, so such an output can differ between runs; every corpus we measure stays at about 1 GiB, far under the budget, and its output is unchanged.\n","numLines":8,"startLine":1,"totalLines":8}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d79adb7b-3094-4c93-8a9c-75ae5a4ecdd8","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
