{"parentUuid":"8699dcca-ef20-4eab-b622-e2049e1ba456","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018KUUsVP6abnxqZ41HL7nYi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\n3\t---\n4\t\n5\t`ComponentMapping` and `SourceData` gain a crate-internal field each (what a component's body and the rest of its file write in JSX), so neither can be built with a struct expression outside the crate any more: use `ComponentMapping::new` and `SourceData::default()`. Extraction output is unchanged; the declaration cache schema moves to 39, so an existing cache is rebuilt once.\n6\t"}]},"uuid":"e8f6d881-a03b-463f-95b1-b16ad951e7cf","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:00.070Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/jsx-evidence-in-extractor.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\n---\n\n`ComponentMapping` and `SourceData` gain a crate-internal field each (what a component's body and the rest of its file write in JSX), so neither can be built with a struct expression outside the crate any more: use `ComponentMapping::new` and `SourceData::default()`. Extraction output is unchanged; the declaration cache schema moves to 39, so an existing cache is rebuilt once.\n","numLines":6,"startLine":1,"totalLines":6}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8699dcca-ef20-4eab-b622-e2049e1ba456","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
