{"parentUuid":"fccfbbb9-23b6-41b4-ba27-1bba7b7af14e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a4fdab2f-a8e8-4d8b-94dc-8723c2dad09a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D3DmtXNo1wQdefsC4r4sTN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tcargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\n3\tcargo/caliper-docgen: minor\n4\tcargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n5\tnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\n6\tnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: minor\n7\tnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\n8\tnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\tA component built by a factory call gains the props the call's own arguments give it. A style recipe's variant keys become props (`chakra(\"div\", { variants: { inline: { true: {...} } } })` gives `inline?: boolean`; option names give a union of string literals), and the annotated first parameter of a render function given as the call's last argument is read as the component's props type, as for a function component (`createLeafComponent(Node, function Divider({size}: {size?: Size}) {...})` gives `size`). Only props the component's props type lacks are added; a `ref` the factory adds through its result type is not. The declaration cache schema moves to 40, so an existing cache is rebuilt once.\n12\t"}]},"uuid":"7f8344bc-57c4-4826-a340-7a5fc4aa0fc1","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:32:00.935Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8/.changeset/factory-own-props.md","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\n---\n\nA component built by a factory call gains the props the call's own arguments give it. A style recipe's variant keys become props (`chakra(\"div\", { variants: { inline: { true: {...} } } })` gives `inline?: boolean`; option names give a union of string literals), and the annotated first parameter of a render function given as the call's last argument is read as the component's props type, as for a function component (`createLeafComponent(Node, function Divider({size}: {size?: Size}) {...})` gives `size`). Only props the component's props type lacks are added; a `ref` the factory adds through its result type is not. The declaration cache schema moves to 40, so an existing cache is rebuilt once.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fccfbbb9-23b6-41b4-ba27-1bba7b7af14e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf6-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
