{"parentUuid":"d982de62-5dcf-42fb-a872-32a7680f34ab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"59674625-fc38-4f51-adbc-82c364603916","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HoREvtsUeVfuj7okLYU56a","type":"tool_result","content":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\n---\n\n**Storybook Controls no longer list hundreds of inherited props.** A source too large to be a component API becomes one inheritance layer of names, so the Controls panel shows the props you care about.\n\n**Breaking:** the Storybook addon's `collapseInheritedProps` now defaults to `'dependencies'` (it was `'none'`). A source of more than 200 props, or an ambient DOM, ARIA or style-system source of more than 30, is one layer of names instead of one Controls row per prop. Your own props and the notable inherited ones are still listed, but a prop inside a layer gets no Controls row, and a story `args` entry naming one shows as undocumented.\n\n**Action:** set `collapseInheritedProps: 'none'` in the addon options to keep every inherited prop listed.\n\n- Chakra's median props per component fall from 845 to 139, and `Button` from about 1,141 Controls rows to about 146.\n- A source in your own code collapses by the same rule, so a design system's style props (Chakra's `SystemProperties` in Chakra's own repository) become a layer.\n- A collapsed layer never repeats a prop that is listed, with the checker on or off.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"faa8d227-d973-4b80-b4fe-da4b209ac265","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:37:25.641Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"---\ncargo/caliper-docgen-core: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen: minor\ncargo/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-storybook: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-napi: minor\nnpm/caliper-docgen-vite-plugin: minor\n---\n\n**Storybook Controls no longer list hundreds of inherited props.** A source too large to be a component API becomes one inheritance layer of names, so the Controls panel shows the props you care about.\n\n**Breaking:** the Storybook addon's `collapseInheritedProps` now defaults to `'dependencies'` (it was `'none'`). A source of more than 200 props, or an ambient DOM, ARIA or style-system source of more than 30, is one layer of names instead of one Controls row per prop. Your own props and the notable inherited ones are still listed, but a prop inside a layer gets no Controls row, and a story `args` entry naming one shows as undocumented.\n\n**Action:** set `collapseInheritedProps: 'none'` in the addon options to keep every inherited prop listed.\n\n- Chakra's median props per component fall from 845 to 139, and `Button` from about 1,141 Controls rows to about 146.\n- A source in your own code collapses by the same rule, so a design system's style props (Chakra's `SystemProperties` in Chakra's own repository) become a layer.\n- A collapsed layer never repeats a prop that is listed, with the checker on or off.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"dcfe84de-2aa6-425d-ae84-19928eaae3dd","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","branch":"mf6-483","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/