{"parentUuid":"985be375-42b7-4231-aa16-70bf5ec740ed","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"435fe205-b3e6-442d-a031-86f26462159c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MLH6DV2BV8Sm9m62JoSGz4","type":"tool_result","content":" MIGRATING.md                 | 16 ++++++++++++++++\n packages/storybook/README.md |  9 +++++++++\n 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+)\n59:## Known limits (alpha)\n60-\n61-- A prop inside a collapsed inheritance layer has no Controls row, and a story arg naming one shows as undocumented. Set `collapseInheritedProps: 'none'` to list every inherited prop.\n62-- A story shows caliper-docgen's structural props first and the checker's replace them when they arrive. Without the prefetch, Chakra's `Button` had the checker's props 0.7 to 2.9 s after its request.\n63-- The output schema (version 8) changes when its shape does, so it can change between alpha releases.\n64-- Wrapper calls with no type argument (`createIconLoader('x')`, `lazy(() => import(...))`) are not recognized, so a story for one goes to React's docgen.\n65-- Edits to dependency declarations outside the source directories, including a symlinked workspace package, are not noticed until Storybook restarts.\n66-- Symlinked directories under a source directory are not followed, and no diagnostic says so: their components are never documented.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"7ba839c3-e7e6-4d61-9695-8ab401169cb7","timestamp":"2026-11-16T07:14:33.460Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" MIGRATING.md                 | 16 ++++++++++++++++\n packages/storybook/README.md |  9 +++++++++\n 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+)\n59:## Known limits (alpha)\n60-\n61-- A prop inside a collapsed inheritance layer has no Controls row, and a story arg naming one shows as undocumented. Set `collapseInheritedProps: 'none'` to list every inherited prop.\n62-- A story shows caliper-docgen's structural props first and the checker's replace them when they arrive. Without the prefetch, Chakra's `Button` had the checker's props 0.7 to 2.9 s after its request.\n63-- The output schema (version 8) changes when its shape does, so it can change between alpha releases.\n64-- Wrapper calls with no type argument (`createIconLoader('x')`, `lazy(() => import(...))`) are not recognized, so a story for one goes to React's docgen.\n65-- Edits to dependency declarations outside the source directories, including a symlinked workspace package, are not noticed until Storybook restarts.\n66-- Symlinked directories under a source directory are not followed, and no diagnostic says so: their components are never documented.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"6d6316b2-c57c-4d42-be0f-2802b8dfde2d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","branch":"mf6-483","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"985be375-42b7-4231-aa16-70bf5ec740ed","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.31