{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":15975,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"0a4237cd-c8c7-454d-a5da-d0ba0736ec5c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch6w66VAeibt2dEk9q5pZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The T4 worker is running, and I started it before replying to your first point, about not calling it an \"add-on\".\n\n**The naming.** I read your point as: the TypeScript checker is the default engine now, not an optional add-on. I'll stop describing it that way in docs and changesets. I'm using \"the TypeScript checker (on by default)\" and \"the checker lane\". I'll sweep the docs, changesets and READMEs for wording that still treats it as optional or \"add-on\", and for the opt-out wording around it. I haven't done the sweep yet, and I haven't confirmed whether you meant the Storybook package, which is literally an addon in Storybook's terms, so tell me if you meant something else.\n\n**While T4 runs, I'll leave the other items alone.** The 0.11.0 release recovery, the weekly oracle's Node heap setting and the clean re-timing all wait. T4 changes what the output lists, so the final numbers, the `STATUS.md` refresh and the changeset for it should come after T4 lands."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8506,"cache_read_input_tokens":806978,"output_tokens":328,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8506,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":328,"cache_read_input_tokens":806978,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8506,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8506},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassif