{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","prNumber":490,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/490","prRepository":"orin-dx/caliper","timestamp":"2026-11-16T17:33:58.096Z"}
{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":15975,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"596ed970-7272-42c8-9f77-0dfbd134be2e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch71Touqzr4rzUAECkxeD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The T4 listing change is up as #490 (base `main`, trail 405). `Button`'s Controls rows fall from 437 to 10 in Storybook, and the CLI and Storybook now give the same names.\n\n**Rows (checker on, sb-demo)**\n\n| Component | Storybook, before → after | CLI, before → after |\n|---|---|---|\n| Chakra `Button` | 437 → 10 | 150 → 9 |\n| `Badge` | 280 → 3 | 2 → 2 |\n\n`Button`'s 10 rows: `children` (Storybook adds it from the story args), `extra`, `fresh`, `kind`, `loading`, `recipe`, `size`, `spinnerPlacement`, `tone`, `variant`. The 286 DOM attributes for `button` are now names in the element layer. Before this, that layer had 0 members.\n\n**Safety check: no own prop vanished.** Old versus new listing differential for props declared outside `node_modules`:\n- **Empty:** Chakra, Mantine, antd and sb-demo.\n- **shadcn:** 10 `Command*` components lose `children`. They have fewer than 3 call sites, so it is now a layer name. `@types/react` declares it, not the project.\n- **Spectrum (a decision for you):** 972 components lose `aria-*`, `id` and similar props. They're declared in `@react-types/shared/src/dom.d.ts`. ADR 0028 treats that file as ambient by path (the DOM's attributes, like `@types/react`), so they leave the listing. Spectrum's median drops from 11 to 6.\n\n**Corpora, main vs this branch (load 16–31)**\n- No median rows grew, and the JSON stays about the same or smaller. shadcn's total rows fall from 33,249 to 8,738. Chakra's layer names rise from 406,765 to 576,322, since names that leave the listing stay in layers.\n- **First-run memory:** shadcn went from 986 MiB to 1,204 MiB (+22%), and the other four are within about 3%. The worker marked it open. You set a rule to measure memory on resolver changes, so I'd look at it before the alpha.\n- **Oracle on shadcn and antd:** wrong stays 0 and 1, and the right-rate is unchanged (98.7% and 93.0%).\n\n**Gates (worker's report)**\n- Workspace nextest passes (1,645 tests).\n- Lint, doc-check, machete, typos, `just test-checker-lane` and `just test-ts` exit 0.\n- New model tests cover the lanes, the watch/lazy equals fresh check, and mutation proofs.\n- Its `/code-review medium` returned 10 candidates. It fixed 6, and the other 4 are documented as not fixed:\n  - `key` handling for unlayered components in the CLI.\n  - Allocations in `narrow`.\n  - The unused `_mode` parameter, because removing it is a semver break.\n  - A double alias walk.\n\n**Contract changes it made**\n- **ADR 0028:** amended (section A2).\n- **ADR 0023:** it cites ADR 0023 for `htmlAttributes: full`, but 0023 isn't in `docs/adr`, so A2 records the change.\n- **`htmlAttributes: full`:** the default stays, but it now means which attributes are *known*, not which become rows.\n- **Cache and schema:** the parse cache moves to 44, the output schema stays at 8, and there's a `list-props-by-usage` changeset (minor).\n\nI haven't read the diff myself. Before merging I want to: read the code review's unfixed items, and look at shadcn's +22% memory.\n\n**What I need from you:** is hiding Spectrum's `aria-*` and `id` by default (the SharedDom rule) what you want? If not, it's a small change to ADR 0028's ambient-by-path list."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1655,"cache_read_input_tokens":830195,"output_tokens":1284,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1655,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1284,"cache_read_input_tokens":830195,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1655},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c79cdda0-b0d4-44ac-aaae-eeab47731ce5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch71ToSZdJ1Ch8SvhDghP","requestRef":"b777ef1e-704c-46a6-ba79-68993db3d06e","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"66a4dc36-f597-4991-a5c1-3d181e1cd25f","timestamp":"2026-11-16T17:34:07.307Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
