{"parentUuid":"6ae7c764-66d1-4f45-a201-708ba9c2ad20","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"We're getting caliper to an alpha whose Storybook Controls show only useful props, and the current task is cutting memory before merging the usage-based listing change (#490). Next, I start the two memory fixes (retained data, then generic instantiation) once you approve.","timestamp":"2026-11-16T18:24:37.204Z","uuid":"b295d080-da6f-4416-86c2-6721a58bb8a8","isMeta":false,"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
