{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","prNumber":490,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/490","prRepository":"orin-dx/caliper","timestamp":"2026-11-16T18:57:42.958Z"}
{"parentUuid":"6ed6f284-cdd4-4af3-96ca-f11247ecbb62","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch77rC2vxpENuTPdrPvTy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#490's memory fix is pushed as 24438c48. It brings #490 below `main`'s memory on the two projects measured.\n\n**Peak RSS, 3-run median (MiB)**\n\n| Project | #490 before | #490 now | `main` (from the profile, not re-measured) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| shadcn, first run | 1,191 | 976 | 982 |\n| shadcn, structural only | 474 | 359 | 357 |\n| Chakra, first run | 2,009 | 1,825 | 1,866 |\n\nThe +22% from #490 is gone. Output is byte-identical on all five corpora, sb-demo and gate-large, in both lanes.\n\n**What it did.** It stopped keeping a per-component placement object after the merge, and made components that name the same source layer share one list of names instead of cloning it.\n\n**Checks (worker's report)**\n- **Mutation proofs:** three, each making a test fail: keeping project sources in the placement, `leaves` ignoring the name, and `layer_members` overwriting instead of adding.\n- **`/code-review medium`:** no correctness bugs and six cleanups. Two were fixed (borrowed grouping keys, a binary search for the source), and the others were declined with reasons.\n- **Gates exit 0:** lint, doc-check, machete, typos, nextest, `test-ts`, `semver`, and `test-checker-lane`. The checker lane first exited 2 because the `target/release` symlink was missing, then 0. At the final head only core and semantic nextest were re-run.\n\n**Not verified:** `main` wasn't re-measured in this run. antd, Spectrum and gate-large RSS are single runs. No oracle run, which is fine because the output is identical.\n\n#490 is still waiting on you for the Spectrum `aria-*` and `id` decision. I haven't read its diff yet, so I'd do that when you've decided. The instantiation worker is still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_read_input_tokens":875206,"output_tokens":634,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":875206,"cache_creation_input_tokens":272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":272},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9bd491b6-fc35-45ed-9068-b1d31aff0cb4","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch77rBKWgHxrAcHUYWV3Y","requestRef":"4053cd89-7369-4087-99cf-1b8d3dd504b8","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ea69433-4fe9-451a-98d2-7f7ad37e012e","timestamp":"2026-11-16T18:57:47.318Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
