{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","id":"06b4f2f7-60c6-42b9-8be6-064ef4cbf376","timestamp":"2026-11-16T19:02:08.256Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"9803daf85cbe48be5f6ca225f95dc13bf2e5a024e85e5325762dd209c1ad3e02","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"08674b9c-83b8-4572-af30-0384967dc0bd","keep":1445,"tail":["75aee8a5d0737b83b1935e821608f6a4cae271945be81516dbf47088b7fce04a","651d4e91c86e289040f2134b19a6402860f16ed7046a74323b59623bdeefe72f","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1447,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"7ee9af72ef0535860029f66c68c6f145e588becdd3b9f84225b3ca8b31ccb052"}
{"parentUuid":"1dd97a60-0080-45e0-a7bf-2d294cd28611","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch78BmZpJqwjh3Svh56k3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The generic-instantiation change is up as #491 (base `main`, trail 405).\n\n**Peak RSS, 3-run median:**\n\n| Project | Before | After | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Chakra | 1,886 MiB | 1,690 MiB | −10% |\n| shadcn | 961 MiB | 867 MiB | −10% |\n\nOutput is byte-identical to `main` on Chakra, shadcn, Mantine, antd, sb-demo and gate-large.\n\n**What it does.** Generic instantiation no longer opens a fresh whole-project program while the lane programs are alive. It releases the lanes early and reconfigures the existing one. The saving came in below the earlier −14% and −24% bounds, as bounds do.\n\n**Checks (worker's report)**\n- Lint, doc-check, machete and typos, workspace nextest, `test-checker-lane`, the gate harness in determinism and memory modes, and `just semver` all exit 0.\n- Four mutations, each making a test fail with exit 100. One of them, dropping the early release of the converters, is memory-only and can't be seen by a test.\n- Its `/code-review medium` found 9 findings, all fixed in one round.\n\n**Not verified**\n- After the review fixes, only the crate's own tests and lint were re-run, not the workspace run or the gate harness. CI runs those.\n- The dev server's RSS after answering a generic component wasn't measured.\n- Wall time wasn't measured on a quiet machine. The load was 15 to 235.\n\n**Memory picture now**\n- **Chakra first run:** 1,866 MiB on `main` today, about 1,690 with #491 and about 1,825 on #490, since the two aren't combined yet.\n- **shadcn:** about 867 with #491, and about 976 on #490.\n- **Next:** the converter memo (#3, about 1.1 GiB in the component phase) is the only route to Chakra under 1 GiB. It's large and public-API-touching, so I'd plan it as its own slice after #490 and #491 merge.\n\n**Open for you:** #490 (the Spectrum decision), #491, #489 (docs), and the release recovery. I haven't read #491's diff either."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":879018,"output_tokens":727,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":856,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":727,"cache_read_input_tokens":879018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":856,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":856},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5a593a13-9ee3-46e1-9da5-29957e664d9c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch78BmJwgvUYhNyGtdxYh","requestRef":"06b4f2f7-60c6-42b9-8be6-064ef4cbf376","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8874925e-a103-4f45-867d-3474952b4802","timestamp":"2026-11-16T19:02:13.443Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
