{"parentUuid":"923c212f-6196-4aef-bd68-77d5687715d0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch796gMGgXDqMaN7NnGZV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I started the rework on #490's branch. Nothing is pushed.\n\n**While it runs**\n- **The memory fixes stay.** The worker has to hold shadcn at about 976 MiB and Chakra at about 1,825 MiB, within 3%.\n- **#491 (instantiation memory)** is independent of this rework and can merge on its own.\n\n**What it must show, as measured evidence**\n- The demo `Button` lists all of Chakra `ButtonProps`' non-noise members plus the five it declares, with the exact before and after row names. It must not list the 286 DOM attributes, the 706 style props or the 130 conditions.\n- A component whose body reads `props.onClick` or destructures `className` lists them. One that only spreads onto `<button>` lists none of them.\n- A main-props differential that this time includes dependency-declared API props, with 0 violations. It also lists the 20 most common names the noise rule hides, so you can judge them.\n- Row counts for `Button` across Chakra, Mantine, antd, shadcn, Spectrum and react-aria-components, with no blow-up in the medians.\n- The oracle on antd and shadcn is unchanged.\n\nI'll report the final row names and the differential before pushing, and I'll ask you whether any hidden name looks wrong."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10253,"cache_read_input_tokens":897433,"output_tokens":419,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10253,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":419,"cache_read_input_tokens":897433,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10253,"cache_cre