{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","prNumber":490,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/490","prRepository":"orin-dx/caliper","timestamp":"2026-11-16T19:41:48.776Z"}
{"parentUuid":"f3cd7302-18b5-4e4a-a122-0ac2fad1510c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7BDDygYCMpoM8HnmNHb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#490 now lists the main props in full, and it's pushed as d884334e. Two acceptance checks are missing, and one real prop is still hidden.\n\n**`Button` rows (CLI, both lanes agree): 9 → 20**\n- **From Chakra's `ButtonProps`:** `as`, `asChild`, `css`, `htmlContent`, `htmlHeight`, `htmlSize`, `htmlTranslate`, `htmlWidth`, `loading`, `loadingText`, `recipe`, `size`, `spinner`, `spinnerPlacement`, `unstyled`, `variant`.\n- **From the demo's own props:** `extra`, `fresh`, `kind`, `tone`.\n- **Still names in a layer:** the 286 DOM attributes, the 706 style props and the 130 conditions.\n\n**One real prop is hidden: `colorPalette`.** The installed Chakra types declare it inside `SystemProperties`, the large style source. I'd expect users to want it among a Button's Controls. A body-use rule can't recover it here, because the demo's body is just `<button {...props} />`. Whether it should be listed is a policy question for you, and I'd list it as a known exception rather than special-case it by name.\n\n**Checks**\n- **Main-props differential: 0 violations on seven corpora.** The check now includes props inherited from a dependency's API interfaces.\n- **Memory unchanged:** shadcn 972 → 975 MiB, Chakra 1,815 → 1,819 MiB.\n- **Gates exit 0:** nextest, lint, the checker lane, `test-ts` and `semver`.\n- **Changed from my brief:** the generated-source rule is \"a source over 200 members, or a mapped copy of `keyof` over 30\", not a plain size of 30. The worker found a size-30 line hid real APIs.\n\n**Not done (the worker hit its call cap)**\n- **The real Storybook browser check** of the new rows. The CLI and Storybook lanes agreed earlier, so I expect 20 there too, but it isn't confirmed.\n- **The oracle on antd and shadcn** for this rework. The earlier #490 run showed wrong staying at 0 and 1, and this rework changes listing again.\n- I haven't seen a `/code-review` result for this round, and I haven't read the diff.\n\n**Where #490 stands:** CI will rerun on this push. Still open for you: the `colorPalette` question, and the Spectrum `aria-*` and `id` hiding. The Spectrum case may now look different under the new rule, and the worker didn't say. Next I'd do the Storybook check and the antd/shadcn oracle myself, or have a worker do them, before this merges. Should I?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":913279,"output_tokens":900,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":796,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":900,"cache_read_input_tokens":913279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":796},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ba8620a5-14cd-4f24-9d28-1a999db090e7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch7BDDjJMX4eHmZteKWCg","requestRef":"334ba2a6-c09f-41d7-bd2e-7f1a342e86d0","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"bad94168-084f-408a-8460-dc874ea77904","timestamp":"2026-11-16T19:41:55.319Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano