{"parentUuid":"370d5305-7b12-419f-8da3-fe6756d86819","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7G6mMxsNVN2qZFumyfH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the plan. The next step is rule changes on #490 (the pattern work) and everything else follows from it.\n\n**Phase 1: fix the patterns on #490, in two steps (one worker, no pushing)**\n- **Step 1, the highest-value fixes (changes 1–3):**\n  - Decide ambient by the declaring interface, not by file.\n  - A member is ambient only when every one of its declarations is.\n  - Apply the \"generated\" rule to project sources too.\n- **Step 2, the probe failures (changes 4–7):**\n  - Reads promote members from collapsed or large layers.\n  - Hide a mapped copy only when its key interface is itself generated, ambient or a token table.\n  - Follow one-hop aliases of the props binding.\n  - Treat a hook hand-off as forwarding.\n- **Acceptance, re-measured with the evaluation harness:**\n  - Real-API props hidden by mistake: 136 rows today, so 0.\n  - Spectrum's documented `id` and `aria-label*` come back.\n  - Chakra's own-repo `Button` falls from 147 to about 17 rows.\n  - No median blows up.\n  - The probes pass, in both lanes.\n- **Pre-push gate:** invariants, model tests over the new provenance forms, mutation proofs, and `/code-review medium` awaited. The patterns above come from the grammar of source forms, so the grammar sweep is part of it.\n\n**Phase 2: verify before merging #490**\n- The real Storybook browser check of `Button` and a Spectrum-style component (the rework worker skipped it).\n- The oracle on antd and shadcn: wrong stays 0 and 1.\n- Memory within 3% of the current 976 / 1,825 MiB.\n- If feasible, one real MUI and one Radix install, since the pattern evaluation couldn't cover them.\n\n**Phase 3: merge**\n- #491 (instantiation memory) can go any time, and it's independent.\n- Then #490, which now needs no Spectrum decision, since change 1 restores `id` and `aria-*`.\n- Then #489 (docs).\n\n**Phase 4: alpha plumbing, once those merge**\n- One clean oracle run on the merged `main` on an idle machine. That feeds the `STATUS.md` refresh.\n- Weekly oracle fixes: the Node heap for Chakra, and \"not judged\" reported separately.\n- The terminology sweep (\"add-on\" wording).\n- Memory #3, the converter memo (Chakra under 1 GiB), as a post-alpha slice unless you want it earlier.\n\n**What I need from you**\n1. **The 0.11.0 release recovery:** delete the mismatched asset and re-dispatch, or skip with `RELEASE_PENDING_FROM`.\n2. **The addon's default flip in the first alpha:** yes or no.\n3. **The alpha's audience.**\n4. **The \"add-on\" wording:** confirm what you meant.\n\nShould I start Phase 1 now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48,"cache_read_input_tokens":938358,"output_tokens":1703,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":712},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1703,"cache_read_input_tokens":938358,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5b21992d-b762-4370-8892-90bf616589c9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch7G6kRAVGYoXhKdHWavK","requestRef":"00bff3f6-e2e5-4c44-aeb9-a09c361a07f8","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f9551742-dbfa-4456-b494-95e99d0030b4","timestamp":"2026-11-16T20:46:08.004Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","