{"parentUuid":"d274ed2b-c290-4c66-a257-c3d6f2530689","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2d98cb0f-21c1-4611-b63a-0acb059b48d4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YPLzN3c1a6fPtrZmumijCG","type":"tool_result","content":"Location: crates/core/src/relevance/mod.rs:84-90\n\nWhen a complete body leaves a large collapsed source unused, `apply` passes every member here (`relevance/mod.rs:61–62`), and `Vec::contains` rescans the layer for each one. A 3,700-member layer adds about 6.8 million string comparisons per component, repeated when answers are published (`pipeline/revision.rs:125–127`), even for project sources that `add` discards. Index layer membership once, or iterate layers against a set of wanted names, to avoid quadratic extraction and watch work.\n\nLocation: crates/core/src/react_types.rs:452\n\nThis also restricts the expanded on-demand view (`collapseInheritedProps: 'none'`): for props expressed as `ReturnType<typeof makeProps>`, where `makeProps` returns React attributes, structural resolution produces no props (`resolver/chain.rs:255`), so this requests an empty React set. The checker then discards every React property (`semantic/src/component.rs:161`), whereas Full mode previously requested and merged them. Preserve checker discovery when collapse is disabled so the expansion option still returns these props.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6366dd8d-da60-4dec-bd4d-628c3485a759","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:29:36.289Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Location: crates/core/src/relevance/mod.rs:84-90\n\nWhen a complete body leaves a large collapsed source unused, `apply` passes every member here (`relevance/mod.rs:61–62`), and `Vec::contains` rescans the layer for each one. A 3,700-member layer adds about 6.8 million string comparisons per component, repeated when answers are published (`pipeline/revision.rs:125–127`), even for project sources that `add` discards. Index layer membership once, or iterate layers against a set of wanted names, to avoid quadratic extraction and watch work.\n\nLocation: crates/core/src/react_types.rs:452\n\nThis also restricts the expanded on-demand view (`collapseInheritedProps: 'none'`): for props expressed as `ReturnType<typeof makeProps>`, where `makeProps` returns React attributes, structural resolution produces no props (`resolver/chain.rs:255`), so this requests an empty React set. The checker then discards every React property (`semantic/src/component.rs:161`), whereas Full mode previously requested and merged them. Preserve checker discovery when collapse is disabled so the expansion option still returns these props.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5a33e378-ce23-4bae-a549-a78e2e470797","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","branch":"mf-t4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d274ed2b-c290-4c66-a257-c3d6f2530689","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba",