{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":15975,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"fb76c96d-4bfa-418e-bca1-c2bea55f9bf5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KpCr8pS2Y8v9ZfSyVf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The MUI and Radix evaluation is done. It found one more gap, which I've added to the Phase 1 worker's brief as an eighth change. Four workers are still running: Phase 1, the acceptance command, the weekly oracle fixes, and the Chakra memory split.\n\n**Radix:** #490 changes almost nothing. 284 of 289 components are identical to `main`, and `asChild`, `ref` and `forceMount` stay listed.\n\n**MUI:** nothing real is hidden by the classifier, but `className`, `style` and `ref` disappear on 27, 32 and 14 components. MUI ships its components as `.d.ts` files with no body, so the rule sees \"nothing used\" and drops them. That is silence being read as evidence. The eighth change makes \"no analysable body\" mean unknown, so it keeps exactly what `main` listed.\n\n**Not fixed by this PR:** MUI's `Button` and `Select` (`OverridableComponent`) aren't extracted at all by either binary. That's a separate extraction gap on `main`, not part of #490. I've asked the worker for a one-line root cause if it sees one. Tell me if you want it as its own slice.\n\nThe report is at `~/Projects/caliper-fixtures/oracle-run/pattern-eval-mui-radix.md`. The MUI and Radix corpora are installed under `corpora/`, and one command reruns them against the final #490 build."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1496,"cache_read_input_tokens":138737,"output_tokens":466,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1496,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens"