{"parentUuid":"27abd566-c6f6-448d-9e06-8d5e3d40a896","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"873e3c3d-e8b9-4f68-99f2-c643c3899bf3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"feat/list-props-by-usage has fingins:\n\n\n\n<pasted_content id=\"5929\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/core/src/relevance/mod.rs:84-90`\n\nWhen a complete body leaves a large collapsed source unused, `apply` passes every member here (`relevance/mod.rs:61–62`), and `Vec::contains` rescans the layer for each one. A 3,700-member layer adds about 6.8 million string comparisons per component, repeated when answers are published (`pipeline/revision.rs:125–127`), even for project sources that `add` discards. Index layer membership once, or iterate layers against a set of wanted names, to avoid quadratic extraction and watch work.\n</pasted_content id=\"5929\">\n\n\n\n<pasted_content id=\"5929\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/core/src/react_types.rs:452`\n\nThis also restricts the expanded on-demand view (`collapseInheritedProps: 'none'`): for props expressed as `ReturnType<typeof makeProps>`, where `makeProps` returns React attributes, structural resolution produces no props (`resolver/chain.rs:255`), so this requests an empty React set. The checker then discards every React property (`semantic/src/component.rs:161`), whereas Full mode previously requested and merged them. Preserve checker discovery when collapse is disabled so the expansion option still returns these props.\n</pasted_content id=\"5929\">\n"},"uuid":"8f34c5b6-ea19-4d78-9379-baf10f67f333","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:36:01.541Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":381,"turnIndex":835},"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
