{"parentUuid":"3514b8a8-ef7a-48f9-8571-145a183d3899","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7eEiRtW3tB53rpPrgzA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, both findings on change 288 are being fixed, but nothing is pushed yet. Entire still lists both as open because it only sees pushed commits.\n\n- **`relevance/mod.rs:84-90` (the quadratic scan):** fixed in local commit 4c22b134.\n- **`react_types.rs:452` (`none` losing React props):** fixed in the session lane only. The CLI merge still has it, so it is half done. The CLI half is first in the worker's list.\n\nI'm holding the push until the worker's pass is green. That pass also covers 10 review findings from its own review, the Step 2 rule changes, MUI's body-less components, the differential and a final awaited review. I'd rather push once than repeat the push-and-fix loop you objected to.\n\nIf you want the two Entire findings cleared sooner, I can push 4c22b134 now. That clears the first finding. The second would stay open until the CLI half lands, and Entire would run on a partial state. Say so and I'll do it.\n\nWhen the worker reports, I push, check CI and findings, and resolve both in Entire with the commit and test."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":181950,"output_tokens":356,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":450,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":181950,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":450},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"dia