{"parentUuid":"7912d127-1c36-4758-8eb1-412683dd8d3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7eiAEfCDp7obNfbDg7j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The converter-memo branch `perf/converter-memo-interning` is pushed and linked to trail 405, so Entire will open its PR. The remote head is 1335c3d2, not the 06f6eccf the worker reported, and I didn't check what accounts for the difference.\n\n**Result (peak RSS, `main` → branch, median of 3, load 14–27):**\n- Chakra 1,690 → 1,366 MiB (−324).\n- Mantine 734 → 716, and shadcn 850 → 861, both within noise.\n\n**Verification:**\n- **Output:** identical (`stats` dropped) on Chakra, Mantine, shadcn, antd, Spectrum and the demo, both before and after the review fix.\n- **Gates:** lint, doc-check, machete, typos, nextest, the checker lane, the gate-harness determinism and memory modes, and semver all exited 0 on commit 78aec45d.\n- **Not rerun after the review fix:** only nextest, lint and the A/B were rerun. The checker lane and the gate-harness modes were not. CI will cover them.\n\nChakra's peak is now about 1.37 GiB. The report put the floor for this approach at about 1.05 to 1.1 GiB when combined with #491. So #491 plus this slice should bring Chakra to roughly 1.1 to 1.2 GiB, still over 1 GiB, as the memory split predicted.\n\nI'll publish its PR body from `~/Projects/caliper-fixtures/pr/perf-converter-memo-interning.md` once Entire opens the PR. #490's rule-change worker is still working."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":406,"cache_read_input_tokens":187573,"output_tokens":531,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":406,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens