{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":15975,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"442bea18-bfce-4525-9fa1-a0eaaacf8def","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7fcjgWpsLp8TQZnxQzQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The #490 rule-change worker (`fix/list-rule-patterns`) finished its main pass, and its branch is not pushed yet. You've merged #491, #489 and #487 into `main` and merged `main` into #490, so the worker must merge that new head first. I've asked it to merge, resolve conflicts, rerun the gates and the corpora differential, and hand me a pushable head.\n\n**Done on the branch:**\n- **Review findings and Step 2:** the 10 review findings, and changes 4–6 (reads promote from large layers, the mapped-copy rule, one-hop aliases).\n- **ADR and changeset:** the ADR amendment and the changeset.\n- **Both Entire findings:** fixed. `mod.rs:84-90` is fixed in 4c22b134. `react_types.rs:452` is fixed in the session lane in 4c22b134 and in the CLI merge in 2a6ab86f.\n\n**Acceptance, at 2ed72769:**\n- The 146 hidden real-API rows are now 0.\n- The Spectrum median is 11 and the shadcn median is 3.\n- Chakra's own `Button` has 17 rows, and the Chakra median is 9.\n- The main-props differential shows 0 violations on all seven corpora, and the demo `Button` has the same 20 names.\n- Peak RSS is 963 MiB on shadcn and 1,847 MiB on Chakra, about +1.5%.\n- nextest (1,657 passed), lint, the checker lane, test-ts and semver all exit 0. I did not see the worker's other gate results, and the corpora were not re-run after its last commit.\n- The probes pass in both lanes except the hook hand-off.\n\n**Not done:**\n- Change 8, so MUI's body-less components still lose `className`, `style` and `ref`.\n- Change 7, hook hand-offs as forwarding.\n- The Chakra fixture, which is still about 865 rows. The worker says its `declined` guard blocks the fix. I'll read its explanation before deciding if it's a real rule gap.\n\nOnce the worker hands back the merged head I push it, run the acceptance command on that build, and resolve both Entire findings with the commit and test. Change 8, change 7 and the Chakra fixture go in a second round on the same branch."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4209,"cache_read_input_tokens":200565,"output_tokens":754,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4209,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":200565,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4209,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4209},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7cc85eb4-26f6-46ef-a3db-02a32308362f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch7fcjKgx14zDFgAARQen","requestRef":"cd486ba3-175d-4bc4-89b7-f320f9bc5bc0","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ba84d744-e90b-4ece-bba3-2826f34714b8","timestamp":"2026-11-17T01:54:23.797Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
