{"parentUuid":"05637f69-6934-4b29-9dd8-0618f64ecb71","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7fzLk1EBZnq5Qp7JFrF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#490 is pushed at cf51133b, and I confirmed the remote head matches. It was a plain push of a merge that contains the previous remote head, with no force.\n\n**Findings on change 288:** both are fixed in this push.\n- `relevance/mod.rs:84-90` is fixed in 4c22b134.\n- `react_types.rs:452` is fixed in 4c22b134 (session lane) and 2a6ab86f (CLI merge).\n\nI'll resolve both in Entire once CI is up and the findings are fresh on this head. If new findings appear on the push, I'll report them.\n\n**Verification on the merged head:**\n- **Gates:** nextest (1,658 passed), lint, doc-check, machete, typos, the checker lane, test-ts and semver all exit 0.\n- **Differential:** 0 violations on all seven corpora.\n- **Demo `Button`:** the same 20 names in both lanes.\n- **Peak RSS:** shadcn 879 MiB and Chakra 1,627 MiB. Both are lower than before the merge because #491 is in `main`.\n\nAn acceptance run (Storybook rows in a real browser, CLI rows, and the antd and shadcn oracle) has started on this exact head. I'll report it when it lands.\n\n**Still to do on the same branch, as a second round:**\n- Change 8: a component with no body keeps what `main` listed, which fixes MUI losing `className`, `style` and `ref`.\n- Change 7: hook hand-offs as forwarding.\n- The Chakra fixture, which still lists about 865 rows.\n\nNone of these are findings or regressions. They are pattern gaps, and I'll send the worker a brief now unless you want #490 reviewed and merged first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1452,"cache_read_input_tokens":211016,"output_tokens":566,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0