{"parentUuid":"50d94870-9415-4f8b-ad81-e6642c5cd95c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b690b58e-45f2-4181-aadf-bd3519ff7693","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XDnJBx82wdQwZzpJVuP8x8","type":"tool_result","content":"Severity:  medium\nConfidence: 0.94\nLocation: crates/core/src/resolver/chain.rs:597-599\n\nReading a non-curated member of a collapsed source now exposes it through `notable_inherited`, but the checker still treats it as layer-only: `LayerFacts::of` lists only `entry.props`, and `layer_notable` recognizes only curated names (`types/semantic.rs:578–588, 623–628`). Consequently, checker conversion and merging skip this visible prop, leaving its structural approximation even for checker-resolvable types such as `ReturnType<typeof makeValue>`. Include body-promoted notable props in the checker’s keep-and-merge decision.\n----\nSeverity:  medium\nConfidence: 0.93\nLocation: crates/core/src/relevance/props_type.rs:164-165\n\nWith `type Select<T, K extends keyof T> = Pick<T, K>` and a component taking `Select<React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>, 'id'>`, the default view now collapses the explicitly selected `id` unless usage evidence promotes it. The resolver substitutes the arguments (`resolver/chain.rs:272`), but this branch skips generic aliases and `read` examines the unsubstituted `K` (`props_type.rs:79`); ambient members remain eligible for narrowing despite the resulting `declined` flag (`relevance/mod.rs:58`). Substitute alias arguments when collecting picked keys so these deliberately selected props remain listed.\n----","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f25d003d-c5aa-4211-b1ab-16fbf7affe56","timestamp":"2026-11-17T02:03:12.755Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Severity:  medium\nConfidence: 0.94\nLocation: crates/core/src/resolver/chain.rs:597-599\n\nReading a non-curated member of a collapsed source now exposes it through `notable_inherited`, but the checker still treats it as layer-only: `LayerFacts::of` lists only `entry.props`, and `layer_notable` recognizes only curated names (`types/semantic.rs:578–588, 623–628`). Consequently, checker conversion and merging skip this visible prop, leaving its structural approximation even for checker-resolvable types such as `ReturnType<typeof makeValue>`. Include body-promoted notable props in the checker’s keep-and-merge decision.\n----\nSeverity:  medium\nConfidence: 0.93\nLocation: crates/core/src/relevance/props_type.rs:164-165\n\nWith `type Select<T, K extends keyof T> = Pick<T, K>` and a component taking `Select<React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>, 'id'>`, the default view now collapses the explicitly selected `id` unless usage evidence promotes it. The resolver substitutes the arguments (`resolver/chain.rs:272`), but this branch skips generic aliases and `read` examines the unsubstituted `K` (`props_type.rs:79`); ambient members remain eligible for narrowing despite the resulting `declined` flag (`relevance/mod.rs:58`). Substitute alias arguments when collecting picked keys so these deliberately selected props remain listed.\n----","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1d80f1f8-3407-475b-b49d-5543ca8fe6e4","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","branch":"mf-t4","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/caliper","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c9