{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","id":"29eb533c-5d4f-4d43-a3c0-47d8eab9d018","timestamp":"2026-11-17T02:03:24.965Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"9803daf85cbe48be5f6ca225f95dc13bf2e5a024e85e5325762dd209c1ad3e02","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"97e4bdb2-628f-4e4c-90db-ade6ccf825c8","keep":143,"tail":["1ee96d97540e549fb9d8040f0ffea589c4534b1808dcb16f83014e6be35d558a","7d3c461ea7260b4d81c3ae01ab261c9a725a2cacb5f2c16345eb56e62d0e78bd","d37ebbfdce5d5adb90079436d385fd6ea7c78d1a6f915a46e655b2291d2a2d82"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",145,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"4b0b2ce2569b6ccfc4b119e1ba5079aae594aff4099461d46440950212c0f860"}
{"parentUuid":"8e1af8a8-d1c2-4971-90af-00411e43768d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7gK3GZJNo92RvemsDUB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The acceptance run on the pushed #490 head passes all five checks, and two new findings have appeared on that head.\n\n**Acceptance on cf51133b:**\n- Storybook `Button` shows 21 rows (the 20 CLI names plus `children`), `Badge` shows `children`, `asChild` and `variant`, and `Card` and `Input` are unchanged.\n- The oracle is unchanged: shadcn 98.7% with 0 wrong, antd 93.0% with 1 wrong.\n- The CLI row totals moved:\n\n| Corpus | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| antd | 4,975 | 4,966 |\n| shadcn | 11,142 | 11,700 |\n| Spectrum | 18,739 | 23,454 |\n\n  Spectrum and shadcn rise because documented props such as `id` and `aria-label*` and the React Aria API are restored.\n- The earlier two findings are no longer open.\n\n**New findings on change 288.** They are one class, a prop that is explicitly selected or read but that one of the two owners (the structural pass and the checker) doesn't see as listed:\n1. `resolver/chain.rs:597-599`: a body-promoted prop that isn't on the curated list is skipped by the checker's merge. It keeps its structural approximation even for types the checker can resolve, such as `ReturnType<typeof makeValue>`.\n2. `relevance/props_type.rs:164-165`: `Pick` through a generic alias, as in `Select<HTMLAttributes, 'id'>`, collapses the explicitly chosen `id`, because the alias arguments are never substituted.\n\nI've sent both to the worker as a class fix, not two patches. It does a grammar sweep over every form of explicit key set (direct, through a generic alias, nested and so on), using the checker as the oracle for what the set is, plus a model test that every visible row in the structural output survives the checker merge. It reports as soon as that commit is green and after `/code-review`, and I push it then.\n\nCI on #490 is still pending (Rust, the checker lane and coverage). After the findings fix, the worker continues with change 8, change 7 and the Chakra fixture as separate commits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4777,"cache_read_input_tokens":216664,"output_tokens":721,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4777,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":216664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4777,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4777},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c245808f-2d33-42a3-90c8-1ae55d313d4d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch7gK2dcK38dyWx48DQEJ","requestRef":"29eb533c-5d4f-4d43-a3c0-47d8eab9d018","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"58b04b2f-564c-4fa1-af66-0f3fcdfc1dcf","timestamp":"2026-11-17T02:03:30.070Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
