{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":15975,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"5413c7da-288a-46cc-b945-675e7b7fb2f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7gQXBj1U14T1oKSSKSa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Change 291 is `perf/converter-memo-interning` (the converter-memo slice). It is linked to trail 405 and its gates show head 1335c3d2, but no PR exists yet. Entire opened one for 290 (#492, the weekly-oracle fix), and for 291 it hasn't, as of my last check.\n\nI linked it a few minutes ago, so Entire may just be slow. The repo rule is that Entire opens PRs and I don't run `gh pr create` myself. The shim route does exist, but it needs your Touch ID approval.\n\nWhich do you want?\n1. I wait and check again shortly. This is the default, and it keeps the Entire-opened PR with its marker.\n2. I open it through the `gh` shim, which prompts you for Touch ID. I would then link it at once, so it makes no duplicate.\n\nIf the PR still hasn't appeared after another check, I'll tell you instead of waiting indefinitely."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1600,"cache_read_input_tokens":224467,"output_tokens":304,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1600,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":304,"cache_read_input_tokens":224467,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1600,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1600},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c9492840-e71e-49ef-b7af-8aa2c2108e8a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch7gQWvLspQfGqTDVLvpK","requestRef":"003f4bba-9027-4c17-b480-e002f07fff09","r