{"parentUuid":"a4ec0f48-f9fb-4aaf-a2e0-977ac75c40a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7jRUnV5RgEv4M1952Q1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's where things stand. The #490 worker was cut off when the session restarted, and I've resumed it to fix the two open findings first.\n\n**Open PRs, all blocked on CI or your approval:**\n- **#490** (`feat/list-props-by-usage`, change 288): pushed at cf51133b, with 2 open findings.\n- **#492** (`fix/weekly-oracle-measurement`, change 290): the weekly-oracle fix.\n- **#497** (`callisto/version-packages`): the release PR, which I haven't looked at.\n- **#493–#496:** dependabot PRs.\n- **Change 291** (`perf/converter-memo-interning`): still has no PR. See below.\n\n**On #490:**\n- **What's pushed:** cf51133b. All five acceptance checks pass on it, with the same `Button` and `Badge` rows and the same oracle result as before.\n- **The two open findings:** they are one class, a prop that is explicitly selected or read but that the checker or the generic-alias path doesn't see. They are the two findings in `chain.rs` and `props_type.rs` from my earlier message.\n- **Worker brief:** the fix is a class-level change with a grammar sweep, model tests and mutation proofs. After an awaited `/code-review`, it reports a green SHA and I push.\n- **Later commits on the same branch:** after the findings fix come change 8 (MUI's `.d.ts` components with no body keep their `className`, `style` and `ref`), change 7 (hook hand-offs) and the Chakra fixture (still about 865 rows).\n\n**Merged since the last status:** #491 (instantiation memory), #489 (docs) and #487 (Wisp v5), which you merged.\n\n**Needs your decision:**\n1. **Change 291:** still no PR. Wait for Entire, or open it through the shim with your Touch ID?\n2. **The 0.11.0 release recovery:** delete the mismatched asset and re-dispatch, or skip with `RELEASE_PENDING_FROM`. #497 is a new release PR, so please say if it's the one to use.\n3. **Addon default flip:** whether the Storybook addon's default flip ships in the first alpha.\n4. **Alpha audience.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3758,"cache_read_input_tokens":239871,"output_tokens":735,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3758,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":239871,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3758,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3758},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d2a41c8b-5193-4994-946e-6facf85bde73","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch7jRUXbxnZdm9tfrm6TS","requestRef":"0efa2238-e893-47b3-9ac6-e9483e880174","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a03b8ece-9c55-4b70-8eab-248133186b4d","timestamp":"2026-11-17T02:44:18.321Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
