{"parentUuid":"6efcf035-4523-44b4-92e5-9d8896391aa5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch989jGrYTb9kog7Y5NiY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1042,"cache_read_input_tokens":287563,"output_tokens":1237,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":486},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1042,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1237,"cache_read_input_tokens":287563,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1042,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1042},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9380,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"c511dd87-bf81-4db5-a64a-4b48df0b4649","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch989ivGweWsnNQErpvaE","requestRef":"99303cf4-1bfe-4413-9af1-2116aa1de416","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0f4e6a67-8716-4a82-b716-a6dd67332aee","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:23:01.868Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
{"parentUuid":"0f4e6a67-8716-4a82-b716-a6dd67332aee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch989jGrYTb9kog7Y5NiY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The dependabot failures are not mostly over-engineering. The main cause is that `main` itself is red on a dependency-advisory check, and dependabot inherits that.\n\n**What fails**\n- **#493, #494, #495:** only two checks fail on each. \"Audit\" runs `cargo deny` and fails on two advisories that are new in the RustSec database, `humantime` unmaintained (RUSTSEC-2026-0542) and `xattr` unsound (RUSTSEC-2026-0486). The aggregate \"CI\" job then fails because Audit did. Neither is the dependabot change's fault.\n- **`main` is red for the same reason:** its last two CI runs (#498 and #305) failed. #491 on 16 November was the last success. Every PR from now on fails Audit until it is fixed.\n- **#496:** this one is different. It's a single group bump of 20 npm packages, and it also breaks the Node 24/26 tests, the Vite plugin tests and coverage. I didn't find the root cause, but a 20-package group is too big to diagnose or land as a unit.\n- **Entire Gates:** also fail on all four, after about 4 minutes. I didn't investigate why.\n\n**Are we over-engineered?** The test suite is not the problem. Three things are:\n1. **The advisory gate is all-or-nothing.** \"Unmaintained\" and \"unsound\" advisories with \"no safe upgrade\" can't be fixed by a bump, so they block everything until someone triages them. Those two come in through `watchexec` and its dependencies.\n2. **Dependabot groups are too coarse.** A 20-package group fails as a whole whenever any one package breaks.\n3. **Nothing separates \"red because of main\" from \"red because of this change\".** Dependabot can't be automated on a red baseline.\n\n**What I'd do:** accept these two advisories in `deny.toml` with a written reason and an expiry date, so Audit goes green on `main`, and set unmaintained advisories to warn instead of fail. I'd also split the npm group, and auto-merge dependabot only when everything is green. Accepting an advisory is a risk decision, so it's your call. I can have a worker do all of it on one branch.\n\n**Also:** #490 merged at 20:21 UTC today, so its findings fix is on `main`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1042,"cache_read_input_tokens":287563,"output_tokens":1237,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":486},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1042,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1237,"cache_read_input_tokens":287563,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1042,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1042},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c511dd87-bf81-4db5-a64a-4b48df0b4649","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Ch989ivGweWsnNQErpvaE","requestRef":"99303cf4-1bfe-4413-9af1-2116aa1de416","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7c3098f0-f927-4c4f-b218-ea5feab641fd","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:23:02.081Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf-t4","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
