h, why it does not affect us, and a review-by date (30 days). Do not weaken any other deny setting (bans, licenses, sources). Gates: `just deny` exit 0, `just lint doc-check machete typos` exit 0 (lint needs the sandbox disabled for pnpm), `cargo build --locked`. No changeset (CI config only) unless AGENTS.md requires one. PR note at /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/pr/fix-deny-new-advisories.md (## What with each advisory and its decision, ## Evidence with exit codes, ## Not verified, session URL). Cap 40 tool calls. Final message at most 80 words: SHA, each advisory and the decision (upgraded or ignored and why), exit codes."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":520,"cache_read_input_tokens":291785,"output_tokens":1333,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":225},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":520,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1333,"cache_read_input_tokens":291785,"cache_creation_input_tokens":520,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":520},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_011RYwPvaBjPWqAa19dMHNFf":{"description":"Fix the cargo-deny Audit failure that reds every PR","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","isolation":"worktree","prompt":"Make the `Audit` CI job (`just deny`, cargo-deny) pass on main. Start from `origin/main` (`git fetch origin` first); branch `fix/deny-new-advisories`; commit locally (Claude-Session trailer per repo rules); I push. Read worker-contract at /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/worker-contract.md, AGENTS.md, `deny.toml`, the `deny` recipe in the