{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","prNumber":503,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/caliper/pull/503","prRepository":"orin-dx/caliper","timestamp":"2026-11-17T20:33:49.873Z"}
{"parentUuid":"dee2eb23-e24c-4061-97e9-a7bf9833eaec","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch98zCjghedBWhd3fdLWx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Audit fix is pushed as `fix/deny-new-advisories` at c8519cce, and linked to trail 405. Entire should open the PR. I confirmed the remote head matches.\n\n**What the worker found, and why it changes what I told you**\n- **`humantime` (RUSTSEC-2026-0542, unmaintained):** it comes in through `trycmd` and `humantime-serde`, which are dev-dependencies only, and the latest `trycmd` has no fix. I had said it came in through `watchexec`, and that was wrong. The worker added one ignore entry to `deny.toml` with the reason and a review-by date of 2026-12-17.\n- **`xattr` (RUSTSEC-2026-0486, unsound):** not in `Cargo.lock`, so there is nothing to fix. My earlier reading of that log was wrong. The output I read listed an advisory, but it isn't present in the dependency tree.\n- **Other advisories:** none fail. Only `deny.toml` changed.\n- **Gates:** `just deny`, `just lint doc-check machete typos` and `cargo build --locked` all exit 0.\n\nThe ignore is a risk acceptance you can review in the PR. It only covers a dev-dependency, and the expiry date forces a recheck in a month.\n\n**Once this merges:** the Audit failure on #493, #499, #500, #501 and #502 clears when each branch has `main` merged in. Dependabot can rebase its own PRs on request, and I'll merge `main` into #499 since it's ours. Some PRs may still have their own failures. #496's npm group did, and I haven't diagnosed it.\n\nThe release PR #497 fails only on Entire Gates, which I didn't investigate."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":413,"cache_read_input_tokens":303460,"output_tokens":566,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_reques