{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":26071,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"17a3ffaa-d73e-4c0b-ac35-e2c4bd21287e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9B8Knp3Z2EJSfvz6fPd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, update the branches once #503 has merged, and not before.\n\n- **Why you wait:** Audit fails on `main` itself, so every PR inherits the failure until #503 is in. #503 is the PR Entire opened for the `deny.toml` fix. It ignores the `humantime` advisory with a written reason and a review date, and it's the only change.\n- **After #503 merges:** use \"Update branch\" on #499, #493, #500, #501 and #502. On the dependabot PRs you can instead comment `@dependabot rebase`. Then look at each PR for anything other than Audit. #496 had real npm, Vite and coverage failures before this, so it may stay red.\n- **#499's finding:** the open finding on `resolver/named.rs` concerns code already on `main`, not code in #499. #499 changes only `convert.rs`, `lib.rs` and a changeset. A worker is checking whether the finding is real. If it is, the worker fixes it as its own slice and reports. If it isn't real, the worker stops and says so with evidence.\n\nThe enum worker is the only agent running. Nothing else of mine is pending on #499."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5817,"cache_read_input_tokens":306650,"output_tokens":369,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5817,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":369,"cache_read_input_tokens":306650,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5817,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5817},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagno