{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytvK9B32ZaSUaSe6aAZ","lastSequenceNum":26071,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"f6a48943-c355-48e0-93ed-285538b757fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9BzUfz1WXkYShHPdJCC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The enum finding on #499 is real, and I'm still waiting for the worker's fix to land.\n\n- **What the worker did:** it reproduced the bug on current `main`. `Level.Low` with `1 << 2` came out as the string `\"Low\"`, and the public `enums` map also carried member names. It wrote the fix, and its new tests, the checker-oracle model test, fmt and clippy all passed.\n- **Why it isn't committed:** the repo's pre-commit hook runs `cargo deny`, which fails on `main` until #503 merges. The worker's call budget also ran out. Core nextest had 2 failures from a missing `node_modules`. It never ran lint, semver, the checker lane or the mutation proof.\n- **What I've asked for:** merge the deny-fix branch so the hook passes, without `--no-verify`. Then install the node dependencies, run the skipped gates and the mutation proof, commit, and report. If #503 merges first, the merge becomes trivial.\n\nThat finding is on code already in `main`, and the fix will be its own PR. Merging #503 is still the step that unblocks everything. #499, the dependabot PRs and this fix all wait on it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4083,"cache_read_input_tokens":317506,"output_tokens":386,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4083,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":386,"cache_read_input_tokens":317506,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4083,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4083},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_