{"parentUuid":"1d8923e7-29b7-454a-826d-5b636b1295ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch9C2hJZNNzkGYQ2Y5Uxy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No, I'm not confident everything is fixed. One thing is verified, and several are not.\n\n**Verified:** the deny fix works. On #503 every GitHub check passes: Audit, Rust, the checker lane, Lint, SemVer, Coverage and the rest. Entire Gates is the one failure, after 28 minutes. That is Entire's own gate, which needs your approval, and I haven't looked into it.\n\n**Not fixed or not verified**\n- **#503 isn't merged.** Until it is, `main` and every other PR keep failing Audit. This is the main blocker, and it's your merge.\n- **The enum fix** (change 291's finding) is still being committed. The worker skipped lint, semver, the checker lane and the mutation proof, and I've asked for them. Nothing is pushed.\n- **#499 (converter memo):** its only visible failure was Audit, but its other checks never ran that far. I haven't seen them pass. The worker also skipped some gates after its last review fix.\n- **Dependabot PRs:** they should pass Audit after you update them. I haven't tested that. #496's real npm, Vite and coverage failures are undiagnosed.\n- **#497 (release PR):** failing on Entire Gates, uninvestigated.\n- **Entire Gates generally:** they failed or sat pending on several PRs. I haven't worked out what they need.\n- **The pattern gaps:** change 8 (MUI), change 7 (hook hand-offs) and the Chakra fixture are still not done.\n\nAfter #503 merges and the branches are updated, I'll recheck each PR and tell you what's still red."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1131,"cache_read_input_tokens":322027,"output_tokens":528,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"